{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108260","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1510826001:0":{"text":"보칼리스인, 여긴 아쿠보르의 영지다. 넌 누구고, 여긴 왜 온 거지?","source_cn":"呼临人，此处是雅库伯尔的领地，你是谁？来做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F7BD95B75D624A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510826002:0":{"text":"루나애니의 언어에는 \"고맙다\"는 말이 없는 건가?","source_cn":"在兽人的语言里，是不是没有“谢谢”这个词？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91A54A5E712AC88F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510826003:0":{"text":"난 고맙다는 말을 하지 않아.","source_cn":"我从不言谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D2CA2CAEC62CDC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510826004:1":{"text":"다치지 않았으니, 조심해서 돌아가도록 해.","source_cn":"既然你没受伤，自己回去的时候多加小心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1CA62E957855D93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510826005:0":{"text":"잠깐, 아직 내 질문에 대답하지 않았어.","source_cn":"等等，你还没有回答我的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB21D68AC751477E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},